docs(baton): adopter notification package for Track C — BATON.md x3 + pointers + Discussion draft

The Track C delivery chain had one remaining gap: the adopter kit existed
(experiment-baton/07-track-c-adopter-kit.md), the binary channel existed
(release-baton.yml, straymark-baton 0.2.0), but nothing told an adopter
either thing existed. This commit builds the notification stack, mirroring
how Loom was introduced to adopters and adding the direct-push piece Loom
didn't need.

